 <h3><u>Maula ali ali</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Muala ali ali..(4)<br> Deen ka daata jagat ka malik sabka palanhaar<br> Muala ali ali..(4)</p> 
  <p>1. Tere siwa woh kaun hai jiske dar pe taara utra hai..(2)<br> dharti se aakash talak bus tera sikka chalta hai<br> mere maula,<br> suraj tere hukm se nikla ek din me do baar</p> 
  <p>2. Tere charan ki dhool ke aage kya chandi kya sona hai..(2)<br> dharti chaand sitare sab kuch tere husn ka sadqa hai<br> tera paseena,<br> tere maathe ka hai paseena nabi wali awtaar</p> 
  <p>3. Meesam salma'n aur abuzar sab humko pehchane hai..(2)<br> tere gali ke mangte hai hum qambar humko jaane hai<br> bhejde maula,<br> bhejde ab hasnain ka sadqa karde beda paar</p> 
  <p>Deen ka daata jagat ka malik sabka palanhaar<br> Muala ali ali..(4)</p> 
